                                                "sense_id": "a1851044-adca-371d-81ec-4fccf31d059a",
                                                "text": "They had planned to open another shop downtown, but their plan had a few kinks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ef10ee1-89aa-3066-af3a-07cff49610f4",
                                        "entry_id": "11bb2f04-9aeb-3bbc-b911-e9c5266bd2bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An unreasonable notion; a crotchet; a whim; a caprice."
