                                                "sense_id": "2ef10ee1-89aa-3066-af3a-07cff49610f4",
                                                "text": "Never a Yankee was born or bred / Without that peculiar kink in his head / By which he could turn the smallest amount / Of whatever he had to the best account."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "431fd1ae-2d65-4303-9e22-579579fa0d73",
                                                "sense_id": "2ef10ee1-89aa-3066-af3a-07cff49610f4",
                                                "text": "\"Still, boozers can be worked sometimes. Most people can, if you encourage their kink. One old woman staked me for three months because she got such a kick out of scandalmongering the neighbours to me.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "707603a4-521b-35d3-9684-1998f3977580",
                                        "entry_id": "11bb2f04-9aeb-3bbc-b911-e9c5266bd2bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peculiarity or deviation in sexual behaviour or taste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3290b743-877e-4949-936f-1e6f3ba9987f",
                                                "sense_id": "707603a4-521b-35d3-9684-1998f3977580",
                                                "text": "To top it all off, Lynn is into kink. Last night she was really into kink. It's a good thing that today is my day off because I need the time to recuperate and think things over."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6619cfdf-a7e3-308f-ae3b-133a330e6896",
                                        "entry_id": "11bb2f04-9aeb-3bbc-b911-e9c5266bd2bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with peculiar sexual tastes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "358c371e-b1bd-41e9-859d-facfdfb880e0",
                                                "sense_id": "6619cfdf-a7e3-308f-ae3b-133a330e6896",
                                                "text": "\"What do they think you know?\"\n\"No more than I've told you. That he's a kink. He rapes people and kills people and spends too much money and flies grass in.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a3e3cfd-963a-4d21-8066-d0034edcb309",
                                                "sense_id": "6619cfdf-a7e3-308f-ae3b-133a330e6896",
                                                "text": "“He's a kink. All I have to do is toss off my clothes and dance around his apartment while he sits and drools.”"
